DEFINITION: A (mean of log gaps)
  theta_A = mean over post cells of [log(trade) - log(y_hat_0)]

COLUMNS:
  pair:         Pair identifier
  theta_A:      Definition A effect estimate
  n_post_cells: Number of qualifying post cells

ROWS: 15683
SUBSET: Placebo pairs, split-half qualifying (>= 2 cells in each split half)

INV-048 NOTE:
  This file now contains only the 15683 qualifying placebo pairs (previously
  17200 full population). The qualifies column has been removed since all rows
  in this file qualify by construction. The full population (17200) is used by
  T23_anchor.csv; this subset (15683) is used for reliability analysis.

